WEBVTT

00:21:59.663 --> 00:22:04.246
You're so focused on making sure you fit
in that everyone around you is OK

00:22:04.246 --> 00:22:06.288
and happy and cool. You're

00:22:06.288 --> 00:22:11.329
so tuned in to everyone else's emotions
that eventually you end up losing touch

00:22:11.329 --> 00:22:14.871
with yourself and often with your
own emotions completely.

00:22:15.496 --> 00:22:16.788
And that's what happened to me,

00:22:17.121 --> 00:22:21.829
which means I've missed a lot of signals
in my life staying in a job longer than

00:22:21.829 --> 00:22:26.121
I should have doing work. I wasn't
passionate about making life decisions

00:22:26.121 --> 00:22:29.163
based on other people's needs, not my own.